544
01:05:17,560 --> 01:05:19,480
Lo lamento, Capitán.

545
01:05:19,480 --> 01:05:21,720
Oh, "Lo lamento, Capitán."

546
01:05:21,720 --> 01:05:23,320
"Lo lamento, Capitán."

547
01:05:23,320 --> 01:05:25,200
